doc:Factsarticle1_24 schema1:description "The article constructs a novel THD health indicator, demonstrates THD monotonicity/robustness/trendability, uses a Wiener process with different drifts for RUL prediction, estimates model parameters online via Bayesian theory, and validates the model on an accelerated experimental test bench; the Wiener+power law model achieves higher accuracy and stability than other Wiener models." .
_:b77867fee6148a59ab61a71f59e593ad rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle1_24 schema1:description "The article constructs a novel THD health indicator, demonstrates THD monotonicity/robustness/trendability, uses a Wiener process with different drifts for RUL prediction, estimates model parameters online via Bayesian theory, and validates the model on an accelerated experimental test bench; the Wiener+power law model achieves higher accuracy and stability than other Wiener models." )>> ;
